  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agribusiness.Location: Lusaka, Zambia.Summary: the proposed project aims to provide a digital platform for Zambian agricultural communities. This digital platform will enable farmers to farmer interaction, funder to farmer interaction, government to farmer communication, price tracking and information, e-Extension services, agricultural alert systems, and locations services for service providers.</narrative>
